%% Planned iterative SDLC, v0.1.0, 2026-10-24.
flowchart TD
    idea[Define problem and select a small increment]
    requirements[Assign requirement IDs and measurable acceptance targets]
    design[Update use cases, data model, architecture, and workflows]
    review[Check traceability, feasibility, privacy, and scope]
    implement[Implement one end-to-end slice]
    verify[Run appropriate automated and manual checks]
    result{Acceptance criteria met?}
    revise[Record failures and revise the affected design or code]
    evidence[Record actual commands, results, limitations, and test links]
    release[Update change log, status, setup guidance, and version index]
    snapshot[Capture immutable doc version and file-hash manifest]
    next{More planned work?}
    complete[Maintain released evidence and project handover]

    idea --> requirements
    requirements --> design
    design --> review
    review --> implement
    implement --> verify
    verify --> result
    result -->|No| revise
    revise --> design
    result -->|Yes| evidence
    evidence --> release
    release --> snapshot
    snapshot --> next
    next -->|Yes, next version| idea
    next -->|No| complete
